  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PREVENT! Sexual and Gender-Based Violence (SGBV) Prevention and Survivor Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: To reduce Sexual and Gender Based Violence (SGBV) in Zambia (specifically in Northern Province). Specific objectives: SO1) To prevent SGBV by challenging and changing beliefs, attitudes and practices in Northern Province; and SO2) To increase SGBV survivors access and use of comprehensive support services in Northern Province.</narrative>
  </description>
